{
    "title": "Bubble Shooter! Extreme",
    "description": "Take your matching skills to the extreme with Bubble Shooter Extreme. Journey through new galaxies, and let the shooting fun game begin! Download this ultimate fun bubbles game, and explore thousands of intergalactic levels. \r\n\r\nIf you like awesome bubble shooter games and you\u2019re looking to test your logic and strategy skills, download Bubble Shooter Extreme and get ready to experience intense hours of balloons bursting fun! The exciting interstellar adventure is already here! Play now, travel to space and shoot and pop bubbles to clear the board.  Soar across the bubble universe playing the best game!\r\n\r\nLaunch a spacecraft to explore the cosmos. Discover different planets, pop bubbles and unlock new levels and puzzles. If you consider yourself a fan of extreme games, then this bubble pop extravaganza should be on your must-have list!  \r\n\r\nBubble Shooter! Extreme keeps getting better as you advance and encounter more challenging battles. It\u2019s the best game to play when you have some free time, or when you\u2019re looking for a maximal fun activity to share with friends and family.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605 Bubble Shooter! Extreme Is the best space shooter in the store! \r\nCheck out these SUPER ADDICTING FEATURES and see for yourself: \r\n- High action-packed gameplay. Join the battle and fight to defend the bubble galaxy!\r\n- More than thousands of blasting levels to explore. Shooting bubbles was never this fun!\r\n- Easy to learn but can be challenging to master.  \r\n- Awesome graphics and effects.\r\n- Powerful boosts to help you hit and burst all the balls.\r\n- Enjoy a fun adventure in space with the best bubbles game. \r\n- Free to play bubble pop game. No wifi or internet connection is required so you can experience an unlimited balloon popping fun!    \r\n\r\n\r\nBOOST YOUR GAME \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udca3\r\nUse awesome power-ups to create major explosions and great bubble drops:\r\n* Make 7 shots in a row to earn a FIREBALL that will eliminate all the balls.\r\n* Drop 10 balloons or more to get a cosmic BOMB that will explode the bubbles away.\r\n\r\nTake a ride in our spaceship and get ready for an adventure of a lifetime! Visit the bubble space station and work out your tactics to win the battle and save the galaxy. \r\nReady to start the action? Light the bubble fire and attack all the challenges!\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2605 PLAYING this fun action game is easy, all you have to do is follow these steps:\r\n- Drag your finger to move the laser aim, and lift it to blast and explode the colorful balls.                                         - Match at least 3 bubbles of the same color to pop the group and win coins.   \r\n- Clear a level with fewer moves to get a higher score!    \r\n- Harness the powers of the cosmic boosters and blast your way up to victory.            \r\n- See which color bubble you\u2019ll get next and work out a strategy to master all the challenges and win the war! \r\n- Use your moves wisely and plan your shots.\r\nTake a break from your daily routine, join the bubble pop fun game, and burst all bubbles in the most relaxing and addictive puzzle game! \r\n\r\nYou can enjoy this amazing balloon blasting game anytime and anywhere you\u2019d like offline!\r\nPlease note: Your device must have an online active internet connection to download additional levels.\r\n\r\nLiked the game? We would love to get your feedback! Let us know what we can add to make your gameplay even more enjoyable and earn your 5-star review. \r\n\r\nAll rights of Bubble Shooter \u2122 are owned by Ilyon Dynamics Ltd.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Take your matching skills to the extreme with Bubble Shooter Extreme. Journey through new galaxies, and let the shooting fun game begin! Download this ultimate fun bubbles game, and explore thousands of intergalactic levels. <br><br>If you like awesome bubble shooter games and you\u2019re looking to test your logic and strategy skills, download Bubble Shooter Extreme and get ready to experience intense hours of balloons bursting fun! The exciting interstellar adventure is already here! Play now, travel to space and shoot and pop bubbles to clear the board.  Soar across the bubble universe playing the best game!<br><br>Launch a spacecraft to explore the cosmos. Discover different planets, pop bubbles and unlock new levels and puzzles. If you consider yourself a fan of extreme games, then this bubble pop extravaganza should be on your must-have list!  <br><br>Bubble Shooter! Extreme keeps getting better as you advance and encounter more challenging battles. It\u2019s the best game to play when you have some free time, or when you\u2019re looking for a maximal fun activity to share with friends and family.  <br><br><br>\u2605 Bubble Shooter! Extreme Is the best space shooter in the store! <br>Check out these SUPER ADDICTING FEATURES and see for yourself: <br>- High action-packed gameplay. Join the battle and fight to defend the bubble galaxy!<br>- More than thousands of blasting levels to explore. Shooting bubbles was never this fun!<br>- Easy to learn but can be challenging to master.  <br>- Awesome graphics and effects.<br>- Powerful boosts to help you hit and burst all the balls.<br>- Enjoy a fun adventure in space with the best bubbles game. <br>- Free to play bubble pop game. No wifi or internet connection is required so you can experience an unlimited balloon popping fun!    <br><br><br>BOOST YOUR GAME \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udca3<br>Use awesome power-ups to create major explosions and great bubble drops:<br>* Make 7 shots in a row to earn a FIREBALL that will eliminate all the balls.<br>* Drop 10 balloons or more to get a cosmic BOMB that will explode the bubbles away.<br><br>Take a ride in our spaceship and get ready for an adventure of a lifetime! Visit the bubble space station and work out your tactics to win the battle and save the galaxy. <br>Ready to start the action? Light the bubble fire and attack all the challenges!<br><br><br>\u2605 PLAYING this fun action game is easy, all you have to do is follow these steps:<br>- Drag your finger to move the laser aim, and lift it to blast and explode the colorful balls.                                         - Match at least 3 bubbles of the same color to pop the group and win coins.   <br>- Clear a level with fewer moves to get a higher score!    <br>- Harness the powers of the cosmic boosters and blast your way up to victory.            <br>- See which color bubble you\u2019ll get next and work out a strategy to master all the challenges and win the war! <br>- Use your moves wisely and plan your shots.<br>Take a break from your daily routine, join the bubble pop fun game, and burst all bubbles in the most relaxing and addictive puzzle game! <br><br>You can enjoy this amazing balloon blasting game anytime and anywhere you\u2019d like offline!<br>Please note: Your device must have an online active internet connection to download additional levels.<br><br>Liked the game? We would love to get your feedback! Let us know what we can add to make your gameplay even more enjoyable and earn your 5-star review. <br><br>All rights of Bubble Shooter \u2122 are owned by Ilyon Dynamics Ltd.",
